 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. PAREN.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 77  X  PIC 9(7).
 77  Y  PIC 9(7).
 77  Z  PIC 9(7).
 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
 MAIN-PARA.
     MOVE 2 TO Y. MOVE 5 TO Z.
     COMPUTE X = 2 + 3 * 4.
     DISPLAY "C1 0000014 " X.
     COMPUTE X = 4 * (2 + 3).
     DISPLAY "C2 0000020 " X.
     COMPUTE X = (2 + 3) * 4.
     DISPLAY "C3 0000020 " X.
     COMPUTE X = (153 * Y + 2) / 5 + Z - 1.
     DISPLAY "C4 0000065 " X.
     STOP RUN.
